| Q12, cache off (default): `MobilePhone, MobilePhoneModel ...` | 424.8 | 413.4 | −2.7% [−3.1, −2.2] |
| Q39, cache on: `URL ... IsLink <> 0 AND IsDownload = 0` | 13.24 | 12.42 | −6.3% [−9.4, −3.0] |
| Q11, cache on | 155.4 | 146.6 | −5.7% [−6.8, −4.6] |
| Q12, cache on | 190.6 | 181.7 | −4.7% [−5.9, −3.4] |
