- https://github.com/ClickHouse/ClickHouse/issues/109956 and https://github.com/ClickHouse/ClickHouse/pull/109912: a different slowdown of Q11/Q12 (Q10/Q11 there) after #105890, caused by the range reader shrinking the zero tails of sparse filter columns, and its fix. Both measured builds include #109912; this patch does not touch that code.

