Master 8d5702d8ee60fe93378e7830ca1441f2eb05940c (26.11.1.1, 2026-10-26), Release build, clang 21, no LTO, aarch64. The three patched files are unchanged on master 6983f5a16d92c831f350e3aa9995a7a1d6f08298 (2026-10-31) and the patch applies to it cleanly.

