<details><summary>Full patch</summary>

```diff
diff --git a/src/Processors/QueryPlan/RuntimeFilterLookup.cpp b/src/Processors/QueryPlan/RuntimeFilterLookup.cpp
index 4bea2763667..6fd6219f8b9 100644
--- a/src/Processors/QueryPlan/RuntimeFilterLookup.cpp
+++ b/src/Processors/QueryPlan/RuntimeFilterLookup.cpp
@@ -7,6 +7,7 @@
